id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}antisymmetric} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Antisymmetric}_S(R, A) \\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\,\\forall y\\in A\\,((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\to x=y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}antisymmetric} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Antisymmetric}_S(R, A) \\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\,\\forall y\\in A\\,((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\to x=y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is antisymmetric if no two distinct elements are mutually related</li>\n<li>Used in the definition of partial orders</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in V$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文